        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ಬೇಡಿಕೆ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಬೇಡಿಕೆ — bēḍike — \"a demand\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹಬ್ಬದ ಸಮಯದಲ್ಲಿ ಹೂವಿಗೆ ಬೇಡಿಕೆ ಹೆಚ್ಚು. habbada samayadalli hūvige bēḍike heccu. At festival time flowers are in high demand."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Also a demand made by people: ಕಾರ್ಮಿಕರ ಬೇಡಿಕೆ (bēḍike)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಬೇಡಿಕೆ (bēḍike) is native Dravidian, a noun from bēḍu, \"to ask for\", listed with bēḍike in DEDR 5528."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for saying what happens if."
            }
          ]
        },
