          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಪೂರೈಸು — pūraisu — \"to supply\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಆ ಹಳ್ಳಿ ನಗರಕ್ಕೆ ಹಾಲು ಪೂರೈಸುತ್ತದೆ. ā haḷḷi nagarakke hālu pūraisuttade. That village supplies milk to the city."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): ಪೂರೈಸಿದೆ, pūraiside."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Also to complete: ಓದು ಪೂರೈಸು (pūraisu), to finish one's studies."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಪೂರೈಸು (pūraisu) is built on Sanskrit pūra, \"filling\" (CDIAL 8330), with a Kannada verb ending: to make full."
            }
          ]
        },
